# A ZON field open for editing takes the mouse: a press inside it moves
# the caret or selects rather than closing the field; a double-click
# takes the word under the pointer and the next typed text replaces it.
# A press anywhere else still ends the edit. At 120x40 the open field
# starts at column 44 of row 7.
write .mnml/config.zon .{\n    .editor = .{ .tab_width = 4 },\n    .ui = .{\n        .theme = "one-dark", // the look\n    },\n}\n
open .mnml/config.zon
command zon.view
key j
key j
key j
expect screen contains "config.zon › ui › theme"
key enter
doubleclick 45 7
type night
key enter
expect screen contains "\"night-dark\" *"
key enter
click 48 7
type X
key enter
expect screen contains "\"nighXt-dark\" *"
